Z||000005||Smokey||11-27-2000||09:12 PM||||A friend has an 85 Fiero, that color. He had to have one of his headlight covers repainted. It was in a minor accident. Everything was fixed when he bought it, but it had a black headlight cover. I'm not sure where he took it to, but they matched it perfectly. I'll talk to him and get back to ya<BR>||||reg||1
